// Local code-signing configuration (TEMPLATE).
//
// Copy this file to `Config/Signing.local.xcconfig` and set your Apple
// Developer Team ID. The real file is gitignored, so your team ID never lands
// in version control, and `xcodegen generate` keeps it wired up automatically
// across regenerations.
//
//     cp Config/Signing.local.xcconfig.example Config/Signing.local.xcconfig
//     # then edit the copy and paste your Team ID
//
// Find your Team ID at https://developer.apple.com/account → Membership details
// (a 10-character string like "A1B2C3D4E5"), or run:
//
//     security find-identity -v -p codesigning
//
// Local Debug/Nightly builds use Automatic signing with this team. CI overrides
// signing entirely from secrets, so this file is local-only and never required
// for the release pipeline.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOUR_TEAM_ID
